    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cloak &amp; Coin</strong> offers 1-4 players the chaotic thrill of being thieves, just not particularly <i>graceful</i> ones. With a limited number of days to plan, finance and execute the greatest heist Marfit has ever seen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Become A Master Thief! Or at least try to...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From plundering museums, ransacking forgotten dungeons and pocketing goods from busy market stalls, every contract offers new challenges, secrets and treasures to claim. The road to infamy is paved with risk, but each successful heist brings you one step closer to your ultimate prize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/296915ae5ba7d18a7ca78fe621792897.poster.avif?t=1754837916\" width=790 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/296915ae5ba7d18a7ca78fe621792897.webm?t=1754837916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/296915ae5ba7d18a7ca78fe621792897.mp4?t=1754837916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Set Yourself Up For Success:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enhance your thieving abilities with equipment and tools. Whether it\u2019s a shovel to knock out guards, dynamite to break into safes, or potions that grant you and your crew extra lives, preparation is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/3438fd2d5c5f4e72158a561ac03a5bc0.poster.avif?t=1754837916\" width=790 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/3438fd2d5c5f4e72158a561ac03a5bc0.webm?t=1754837916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/3438fd2d5c5f4e72158a561ac03a5bc0.mp4?t=1754837916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Endless Possibilities:</strong></i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is carefully designed to test your thieving skills, but the world of Marfit is never predictable. Item spawns and Curses are randomized each time you play, encouraging replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/846698dd0cebe095b335e7a4a3a1151d.poster.avif?t=1754837916\" width=790 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/846698dd0cebe095b335e7a4a3a1151d.webm?t=1754837916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/846698dd0cebe095b335e7a4a3a1151d.mp4?t=1754837916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Solo or Co-op Chaos:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re working solo or with a crew, the heist of a lifetime awaits, if you can actually pull it off!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cloak &amp; Coin</strong> offers 1-4 players the chaotic thrill of being thieves, just not particularly <i>graceful</i> ones. With a limited number of days to plan, finance and execute the greatest heist Marfit has ever seen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Become A Master Thief! Or at least try to...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From plundering museums, ransacking forgotten dungeons and pocketing goods from busy market stalls, every contract offers new challenges, secrets and treasures to claim. The road to infamy is paved with risk, but each successful heist brings you one step closer to your ultimate prize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/296915ae5ba7d18a7ca78fe621792897.poster.avif?t=1754837916\" width=790 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/296915ae5ba7d18a7ca78fe621792897.webm?t=1754837916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/296915ae5ba7d18a7ca78fe621792897.mp4?t=1754837916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Set Yourself Up For Success:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enhance your thieving abilities with equipment and tools. Whether it\u2019s a shovel to knock out guards, dynamite to break into safes, or potions that grant you and your crew extra lives, preparation is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/3438fd2d5c5f4e72158a561ac03a5bc0.poster.avif?t=1754837916\" width=790 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co